WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.016 --> 00:00:01.919
(playful music)

00:00:01.919 --> 00:00:03.644
(clears throat)

00:00:05.738 --> 00:00:07.394
(chuckles wryly)

00:00:10.754 --> 00:00:12.467
(clears throat)

00:00:16.948 --> 00:00:19.177
(metal squeaking)

00:00:20.873 --> 00:00:22.364
(clears throat)

00:00:23.612 --> 00:00:24.756
- So!

00:00:24.756 --> 00:00:26.306
- So.

00:00:29.642 --> 00:00:31.140
- So you're from Chicago.

00:00:31.140 --> 00:00:32.631
- Yep.

00:00:38.953 --> 00:00:40.961
- So what was that like?

00:00:40.961 --> 00:00:42.546
- It was fine.

00:00:48.065 --> 00:00:50.481
- You know I spent a summer in Chicago.

00:00:50.481 --> 00:00:52.008
- Oh really?

00:01:00.023 --> 00:01:03.496
- So, when I was there
I worked at a comic shop

00:01:03.496 --> 00:01:07.197
and one day this guy
came in and he was buying

00:01:07.197 --> 00:01:08.962
a bunch of t-shirts

00:01:08.962 --> 00:01:11.562
and they were all Firefly t-shirts.

00:01:11.562 --> 00:01:14.699
So of course I asked him,
I was like hey, do you like

00:01:14.699 --> 00:01:16.894
the show Firefly or something?

00:01:16.894 --> 00:01:19.459
And he was like, yeah I'm a big fan.

00:01:19.459 --> 00:01:22.396
And so, I'm ringing him up at the register

00:01:22.396 --> 00:01:25.326
and guess who walks in?

00:01:26.169 --> 00:01:28.618
None other than Nathan Fillion.

00:01:28.618 --> 00:01:30.414
(laughs) Right?

00:01:30.414 --> 00:01:33.107
The whole time I was actually helping

00:01:33.107 --> 00:01:35.347
the brother of Nathan Fillion.

00:01:35.347 --> 00:01:37.999
(laughs sheepishly)

00:01:38.761 --> 00:01:40.415
- That's so funny.

00:01:45.190 --> 00:01:48.988
So I'm really into this
season of Homeland.

00:01:48.988 --> 00:01:50.032
Do you watch?

00:01:50.032 --> 00:01:51.501
- Nope.

00:01:52.389 --> 00:01:54.665
Well I don't get Showtime.

00:01:56.155 --> 00:02:00.133
I used to, but then
the only show I watched

00:02:00.133 --> 00:02:02.513
was Ray Donovan.

00:02:02.513 --> 00:02:05.182
So then I found out that it was cheaper

00:02:05.182 --> 00:02:07.957
to actually buy each episode

00:02:07.957 --> 00:02:10.801
a la carte on Amazon.

00:02:10.801 --> 00:02:13.181
And so then I got an Apple TV

00:02:13.181 --> 00:02:16.153
and through the Amazon app I'm able

00:02:16.153 --> 00:02:18.718
to just purchase each episode

00:02:18.718 --> 00:02:21.458
and it's, it works that way.

00:02:21.458 --> 00:02:24.541
- My ex, he loves Ray Donovan, ugh.

00:02:24.541 --> 00:02:26.092
He kinda looks like Liev Schreiber.

00:02:26.092 --> 00:02:29.933
- Oh wow, he must be super handsome.

00:02:29.933 --> 00:02:31.496
- Yeah.

00:02:35.014 --> 00:02:36.425
- Cool.

00:02:37.128 --> 00:02:39.194
So do you want another drink?

00:02:39.194 --> 00:02:41.736
- Oh no, no I'm good, thank you.

00:02:41.736 --> 00:02:43.425
- Oh okay.

00:02:46.067 --> 00:02:48.853
- So um, you know I
should probably get going.

00:02:48.853 --> 00:02:50.513
I have a busy day tomorrow.

00:02:50.513 --> 00:02:52.189
- Oh okay.

00:02:52.400 --> 00:02:54.281
Well, let me walk you to your car.

00:02:54.281 --> 00:02:55.883
- Oh I'm just parked right outside.

00:02:55.883 --> 00:02:57.294
- Oh.

00:02:59.724 --> 00:03:00.782
- Okay, you know what?

00:03:00.782 --> 00:03:01.943
It was a pleasure meeting you.

00:03:01.943 --> 00:03:03.045
Thank you so much Edgar.

00:03:03.045 --> 00:03:05.842
- It's Elliot, actually.

00:03:05.842 --> 00:03:06.679
- What?

00:03:06.679 --> 00:03:08.774
- Nevermind.

00:03:09.476 --> 00:03:11.730
We should do this again some time.

00:03:15.380 --> 00:03:17.256
How 'bout next week?

00:03:18.396 --> 00:03:20.693
- Maybe, just go ahead and text me.

00:03:20.693 --> 00:03:21.728
- Okay.
- [Gir] Okay, bye.

00:03:21.728 --> 00:03:23.057
- Cool.

00:03:25.886 --> 00:03:26.879
Okay.

00:03:26.879 --> 00:03:28.384
- [Girl] Okay, bye.

00:03:34.001 --> 00:03:35.470
- So how'd it go?

00:03:36.706 --> 00:03:38.343
- Awesome. (laughs)

00:03:38.343 --> 00:03:40.166
Best date I've ever had.

00:03:41.686 --> 00:03:43.231
She definitely likes me.

00:03:43.231 --> 00:03:44.360
Yeah.

00:03:44.360 --> 00:03:45.939
- [Barkeep] Yeah, I don't think she does.

00:03:45.939 --> 00:03:47.704
- Yeah, she had this look in her eyes.

00:03:47.704 --> 00:03:49.710
You know, it was just like (growls).

00:03:49.710 --> 00:03:51.729
- [Barkeep] Yeah, I saw that look.

00:03:52.146 --> 00:03:53.766
- I wanna jump your bones.

00:03:53.766 --> 00:03:55.922
(both laugh)

00:03:55.922 --> 00:03:57.225
Yeah.
- [Barkeep] Yeah.

00:03:57.225 --> 00:03:58.589
- Yeah you know that look?

00:03:58.589 --> 00:03:59.494
- [Barkeep] Yeah, I do.

00:03:59.494 --> 00:04:00.272
- You ever seen that?

00:04:00.272 --> 00:04:02.488
You probably haven't seen that before.

00:04:02.488 --> 00:04:03.488
- How's your Blue Balls?

00:04:03.488 --> 00:04:05.914
- Really, really blue.

00:04:05.914 --> 00:04:07.441
- I mean the drink.

00:04:07.441 --> 00:04:09.868
- Oh yeah, can I have another?

00:04:09.868 --> 00:04:11.093
- Sure.

